{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:fcf734812251be90dc34a90934c51503f69dca87ef2feae1beaf57a59d5c4e8f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fea4231a2d742d6f1cb722e75bf8816337ed121892035112249e6282e21dd11b",
      "text": "蔓延的狂热，潜藏的阴影",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:673eedb9898d2cc0f90a0055dd7e3e99ebe173a991976052cdf8b2dbf1e66edd",
      "text": "出道一段时间后，冬马以顶尖偶像为目标，\n全身心投入到了练习中。\n那份狂热，逐渐在Jupiter内部蔓延开来。\n然而，在这背后，\n也有着黑井社长暗中的不端举动。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3a0c7f8f83c9759bf38e90e810580beff52236c88683724b5c13d354d17d97d",
      "text": "第3话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fea4231a2d742d6f1cb722e75bf8816337ed121892035112249e6282e21dd11b",
      "text": "蔓延的狂热，潜藏的阴影",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:387d957c82421cf5d6bd4f2c00641c9928929c07e1c5783fc9927582749b0e4b",
      "text": "今天的日程是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:497151cf0677aced7f4a34ea72d273c44d0e60b8e20ee7a9699d72f1e0ad77f3",
      "text": "（综艺节目的录制，结束后立刻转场\n去拍杂志。晚上是广播……真是匆忙啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfaa005b7cfc5928ef1e7f382602f15fe41a01f6e8a9af14c4fb1a8d995ceb2b",
      "text": "不过，也逐渐习惯这种生活了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0531e412ef3c60e618298f4a554bd1d29290134c0556786c80e5e926d8ae0c4",
      "text": "（忙于工作和练习，\n做模型和看动画的时间虽然减少了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99508f3011557508a03c6d54c03053934b9dcdf67ade48be3c87b3d353b57a72",
      "text": "（但Jupiter的活动，感觉并不坏）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20675192fcf23f3877a2123c41e67b28f1dc37bcefdc3b1e9a90c65f32fefd67",
      "text": "……只是，很难去上学这点有点头疼啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_a:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bc8fc7af9d89c8e5cf9b5c8d18809013c4520b617dd95e32ce762ec20f6f784",
      "text": "班上的家伙们约我出去玩，\n我也经常因为工作而推掉……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_a:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a8442a062fe7f90b397b8766f7233a8d8684d807102337b8b7abb95f1120a19",
      "text": "哦，来LINK消息了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_b:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42e2e27105d76394f24ec07bbee038b236f7ac4b57b16fcceeb4b20340c8cf79",
      "text": "……“最近你不在学校好无聊啊！\n下次什么时候来啊”，是么。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4df7628764c3ba3391ede494f3838c6bcd7427f132658cd7a0a88f12f3879f7b",
      "text": "哈哈。我也正好在想这件事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1bbf903109725d532c73aaabbc29645224d3b26a173ea123884b8718044c301",
      "text": "毕竟庆祝比赛优胜的事也还没办成呢。\n必须得找机会补偿一下才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3eb1b056dd83889799bb14a6150509af0131ec704069880388e59c109bb1c23b",
      "text": "（但是，我第一次找到了\n能够让我如此由衷地想要“去做”的事情）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e54a743114b068c33854184a0018ae0b3212bbafd979b9e970be57daa73d1a2",
      "text": "（我绝对要成为顶尖偶像！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53768e34b2586c65129b817257ba11e2ef6c15e7bdf5dfec8646da26d5696005",
      "text": "（为此，能做的事情我都要全力以赴。\n工作自不必说，在训练中也绝不妥协。所以——）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbbdf485a87e865c7c147166f18643bcc0af60f7fa50c649ed60641d712ae8e8",
      "text": "“抱歉。等哪天能去学校了我再联系你”……发送。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d101d1ab8ca871d2967729c9c35adc0c713e52bbc90311ed5400d4b65381e550",
      "text": "好嘞。那么，去工作吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_c:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:810a5658f05d758d439918dff3d03448df92f79f9161973ee0f788f5a8780264",
      "text": "……嗯，那就周末见。\n我很期待与你相见哦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c51305d78f60637aed78271710c2b51b249da3bf62ff85fc7c09fedbeff44446",
      "text": "呵呵。和天使酱的约会，真期待啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e588d9020cdfe919988b2d6d9fd133929cbc08a9ba91fbbbe79b1748784cf7f4",
      "text": "（Jupiter出了名，\n电视和杂志的工作增加的同时）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f610d50f1483b368ff09b7d955e08f32e3ccd6d24cfcd1b8805208acbc4d3b4",
      "text": "（与新的天使酱相遇、\n约会的次数也增加了。不过……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01ba6188f4b46a5fee4e4bc54ef20f78177ff6f2334335c049c8716445467914",
      "text": "（工作这边，真希望不要再增加了啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:644663db3953dcbb015b1aabe9124f4681883b3a5b27f74f0fde9f0e79e49cdc",
      "text": "（当偶像，原本只是觉得\n正好适合用来打发时间才开始的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20e1609161c55d4ec17bbe803b5ec6caafd94937b84c49199b1971c6dbfd4f93",
      "text": "（冬马似乎在全心全意地对待……\n但对我来说，未免有点太热血过头了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ce1d79521675bdec79f816571a95d3658a92c3169be3e9ffd29786231bfc09c",
      "text": "（不过……从前我也曾像那样……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:042dac8ecc6af6e8747dc80f46c0d46f70f245077c3912ea6664fb80cbf175e4",
      "text": "……不。真不像我的风格。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_d:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a439de081c8294d1a17031831405992dbd24c9f3b03648539a3aa598ecd162cd",
      "text": "喂，我是北斗。\n难不成，你已经到碰头的地方了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_d:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d34698765531b29a6f4cb6fd0cf188f067e501cacbf448db86e3eb7ea885221d",
      "text": "……有急事？\n我知道了。那就先去忙那边吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:716e512a143563e25e09c2abb18eb63c173cc0f8b92cf4cca7ae225ee69b2e35",
      "text": "啊啊，不用那么道歉。\n光是能听到你的声音我就很高兴了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0fa4e3ce6f185f19a0287f9247811589a4a29242caa5ec893990ff481e2aa0c6",
      "text": "等事情办完了，再联系我吧。\n我们重新定约会的日子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9694160fa99dd4d34e5ab93f0692dee536447f7e148d8faf4b6eeddc0727d3a",
      "text": "今天本该见到的你的笑容，\n希望下次见面时能多多展现给我看呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_d:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e542932aecc3b16319228bc6fb39467aa1ab0332eef5a4af7ad73e5651291683",
      "text": "……呵呵，谢谢。这下我对和你的约会\n变得无比期待了呢。那么，回见咯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_d:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2688bc60ffa3c82bed4f772a82ad6f17787db9ae4089b27bbba96fd09870c0ea",
      "text": "好啦……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:caa1cf09b3f776df2e3bf519b57a4218a89dbc42fe5cc092ec716c2aac7c8c93",
      "text": "（既然安排空出来了，虽然还早，\n干脆直接去舞蹈练习室看看吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4da42e6ae33552ded040343e11d1a41cc9637f56d8b16c3fbc151be337f85f52",
      "text": "（要是有在练习的女孩子，\n就一起去喝个茶……嗯？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_e:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de562c31fdfb0d48730c1c63347d32de11869018a1a442e75e4e1f3c6fe54325",
      "text": "（在那边的人是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e6d3a0ef9711f9d426dd8a970505409e33658b31198243dab1a63298b38e963",
      "text": "～♪　～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2f9f4da912c2207b14a1df68be36468766a48fe1a3923b1e498fba41c17a4c2",
      "text": "……哈！这次脚步很顺畅啊。\n再从头练一遍试试看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_e:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7377fbb4ee6e709bfcc9303a6d7ef203ffdf26cce8c511d4daa87b859205e2c1",
      "text": "（出了那么多汗……\n是练习了相当长的时间吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_e:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0f2e05b93bfda8e8b6679cd70b4ea942c9933f13c3722655a5f625a680b7e52",
      "text": "辛苦了，冬马。来得挺早的嘛？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_e:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:444fe642b6aecd99434991b20e9a5498b2f7b43ad105bce0c4cc0120404aacfd",
      "text": "哇！吓我一跳……\n是你啊，北斗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_e:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a38fb2ac17f64eaa7cc7b4e41a2ef9c1f5200bba223a59a830c0c67fe6be8e2",
      "text": "最近工作变多了，\n舞蹈课程的时间在减少吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_e:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92233dd77f8c634e201723e9119323eac630fa32e635b6e310b5f78cbff222a0",
      "text": "所以我想着能自主练习的时候就多练练。\n练了多少，都会化作自己的实力嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_e:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f22e0b0f02652b73241e7ffa6cff29b2f9ad95e9ac155fdec06fd42c0ac0391c",
      "text": "呼嗯……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_e:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2506b6962303fa59460b0b8b77938a23f3c71c44c6bf50adbe90641af82114a8",
      "text": "（连自己的私人时间都倾注进去了吗。\n……为了偶像这种小孩子的游戏）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_f:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7806075f39689a8018fc97c6f094a2cb885b5e82905553b563f6025a14b3204b",
      "text": "话说回来，难不成……你也是来加练的！？\n真少见啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_f:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9dc8493055c21855bc94ef2475faa887ec4d116fe99cba36b36287039197749a",
      "text": "不，我……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_f:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e267be931e4a36838d078e04a507a3031e76961cc5b90afa6eb5948c73a4a69",
      "text": "……是啊，被你看穿了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_f:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:118a5b977e1b8a9378c27c8fc5deaa070127d4d6b758863c9b8e0ccd5acce4fd",
      "text": "下次要上的音乐节目，\n有很多可爱的女孩子也会出演呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_f:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:892d9a3885559be2c7615b4fe217b6e257d3825f3fab1926880257685e385ff0",
      "text": "我也想表现得帅气一点，\n所以比平时更有干劲了☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_f:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:831c7263ae903037ae61318933fcf264bc1cb4de8c192861d469c701bb62cd04",
      "text": "哇，你还是一如既往是个轻浮的搭讪狂……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_f:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7246a9b2f0ba448a0695e6e968ae1454b0e7107f1429ba46947f3ecce4c0ef2f",
      "text": "呵呵。那我先去换衣服了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_f:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25ad97e6fc401c075a751b79b2b8436c6ea2cc9ac3bb507419cb50d3fac92f69",
      "text": "（……冬马身上，有和我过去相似的地方。\n是因为这样吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_f:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bfeb95f867b282863857df75bfa2c39bfa2232cd4503a66cec3e695a3bdf06a",
      "text": "（待在一起的时候，总会像那时候一样，\n一不小心就跟着热血起来）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_f:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a461967f01a10f919802d6d7dd0d3fe3d5439276ddad18f58e244eb0a6be800c",
      "text": "……在这么想的时候，就已经被影响到了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_g:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:903c1b425bacda171af5ab5569c41beb3b93c8235d860d6173f537404a33bb66",
      "text": "又过了一天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_g:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4828af681830b20ed6429a97e6d08191c33096dec0c6f49c825fb8b1e3bcf4f",
      "text": "哦，今天我也是第一个到的……居然不是！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_g:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:264c44d9d72e96ec764107fc85a857bd903501490c294c11c6265fa2b8093517",
      "text": "Ciao☆冬马，你太慢了哦。\n头筹就由我收下了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_g:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a84fc3d2bab885fd1461cfb146606e59073d724944eb05c6b98264bd1723249",
      "text": "哪有慢啊。离约定的时间还有一个多小时呢……\n你这家伙，也来得太早了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_g:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68be8c97788fcef72d895b172663b22abb2d795d6b9be490f864b578c5a7c4ad",
      "text": "碰巧多出了一点空闲时间呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_g:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b0ef6f549cbd470c7a1f2fcfdaea1175996475f085b7b7f0ba62286e7a51342",
      "text": "去约会虽然也不错，但我觉得来这里的话，\n说不定会遇到更有趣的事情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_g:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23983026e08a2e2eb62194cd7a5d3f34c57703f39d69ecdf4aef952a43599f08",
      "text": "既然看到了冬马惊讶的表情，\n看来我的预感完全命中☆了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_g:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9640f30293416336e94dd3c0119ba1ad84f8d595c792e8b445c6b2e643205bd5",
      "text": "别拿我寻开心啊！\n……不过嘛，你能来我还是挺高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_g:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1edd3fcbcbdb9fa507356f8bb5ccbf902ce80dae3a670bcc9b8859cd2928ed0",
      "text": "比起一个人练，更有干劲嘛。\n嘿嘿，我也去换衣服了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_g:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3af300a426050ee026b6ce5940a11bbc3005c21c90211d1070020090991da94",
      "text": "早上好～……哎呀。\n你们两个，已经开始了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_g:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7dda8eca93ae1323b3e0ae52bef8352dac1dd96c5b7a9c7dfd180c76325726f7",
      "text": "你今天也是踩着点来啊……\n好啦，来做拉伸。我来帮你，坐那儿去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_g:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a104b1125c37cfc8e73d3116b274d3229387cdbb8f5ce62c4765cdd9708b7781",
      "text": "那我趁这个时间，\n稍微休息一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_g:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d81f7685a844acd370956f30aadb8acc72643fe77df8071504dcd684c257da5",
      "text": "总觉得很有干劲呢～\n北斗君也是那一派的人了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_g:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8614ec243f1aabbd005ec1f6989fef68f5d975c10575b08b0e39c2ab93fec12",
      "text": "呵呵。只是一时心血来潮罢了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_g:cmd-000159:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b705242da4423b1f5150c342941ff731e96c9b6811598b0cc263ffc413e0d293",
      "text": "嗯——……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_h:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6d4e7fcf2e36390dafab578cfdf337f0e7b6d30afe2b78fe5e53d3671356002",
      "text": "音乐节目收录结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_h:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b16cfc81ed51f7e976719ceb087525036e1218d16c7f4a3ffd30731c1db22948",
      "text": "Jupiter，很棒哦。\n表现力不是越来越进步了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_h:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b33e452641b2c0ad841cf6c71e3185979f6c6c14d470237d5dafb45c083fd41a",
      "text": "今后也请继续加油，我很看好你们！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_h:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7e8266a78304c6acc523897738228ba5aeafedf9dbc31f8042cd8b7897ef1e8",
      "text": "非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_h:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33069afd4b09f1d7037dba7fbdc870bbead57bebe28a317f46b282e10bdb0c50",
      "text": "刚才也得到了同台嘉宾的夸奖……\n自主练习的成果显现出来了吧。真开心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_h:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f4aa28e2be32cc604e3e66e153f1148d00100c11c4cb3dc824ad24eedd3e746",
      "text": "（冬马君真是的，高兴成那样。\n真的是什么都没发觉啊，好可怜～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_h:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9be1051c06d6ac911e43b246ed6d99493d15145162b0244a735bee007fd2bf98",
      "text": "（原本能上今天的音乐节目，\n就是因为黑酱在电视台那边打了招呼走后门嘛……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_h:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ad388e0091d086e54f4f534a1fd0b9ef83e2d57c413db5cb15b49617f0bf404",
      "text": "（北斗君好像也明白很多事情，\n却完全不打算告诉他呢——）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_h:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:690a9c8d5427a37ac3a09ff69c6bdb54c93e40dc6bfd1e1613f88c5f2da333da",
      "text": "（……嘛，反正我也不会说就是了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_h:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da6fe31367272091bce59b9bc3ffc198b32fa5233acf495d2687396dcc922f50",
      "text": "还有，翔太君的跳舞也超厉害的哦！\n在今天所有的舞台里，可能是最显眼的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_h:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2e463870b1d3f4b1189c695d2adeb1a8e40bdfda656013de4a95eac97958432",
      "text": "非常感谢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_h:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35546b0c56528734eb5453f5ce4fc8d6fffd6e5612fcf3d1f0586329293c1842",
      "text": "不过，拿第一是理所当然的吧？\n因为是我嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_i:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc6e2aafeb9e125b69d1b143f05c66414e6e1a4f46c163a52a6d289efeef27c7",
      "text": "学校",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_i:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:659337746746782cdcfdf0d03d04ea384a64a1c7d04785edf7aee956b4b05a6a",
      "text": "哈啊～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_i:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14f7efd86ff73e3f537a4c403d450a43804951a15430c6b2696d83602391f201",
      "text": "（昨天的工作拖了相当久，好困啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_i:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7e74df489644536014bc979c3eb24f89e111ddfede83f32aadc7750712978ce",
      "text": "（哈啊……好无聊，学校不能早点放学吗——）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_i:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b0591e29301959269e7d7d2c10774e46fc0ad81322e1dd2d3387abbbdf2dd65",
      "text": "呐呐，\n听说下周的音乐节目Jupiter会出场哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_i:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0972577db5a60807e16090b6401e6f1a4933df69028e011fc90225c1cf54f23",
      "text": "真的吗！？绝对要看！\n最近好火啊，听说下次还要上杂志封面呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_i:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9bbae4abf1d4123f7159ffc1e58c4b2fdce69c5cda93caabdf3b16c749d5c93",
      "text": "不过，御手洗君总是很困的样子呢……\n工作很辛苦吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_i:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95cded9a340e3230adb2501f9ba34b2d6f3f280b14c0ac1272aa458d051fb893",
      "text": "（……一边看着我一边说话，\n未免也太明显了吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_i:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33b321e38ad5a73cb506803c9735e7fb0689adcff63b3c9db3cc68d9ad7afa45",
      "text": "那、那个！御手洗君。\nJupiter的工作，感觉如何呀？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_i:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78426b697019a33c01750a64aedae29ff43869a107f244a27c8ec5f3e87f2881",
      "text": "休息的时候，也会跟冬马君\n或者北斗君一起玩吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_i:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5db669dc9fa0d70eada333aa9cfb1fc066fa62082de581356a2cba5ce0bb7e58",
      "text": "啊。那个我也想问！\n三个人在一起的时候，平时都聊些什么啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_i:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a09ea0e54a446f7ee08b42c51e35c19032bc7413a7ce7d267b9aa427567fd6b3",
      "text": "抱歉哦。\n工作以外的事，我不会聊Jupiter的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_i:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7e9554e038c69b1160578ca3a13d34e5fd94e9bd91a0e0bcf8e5b374fc7c5b2",
      "text": "啊……这样啊。\n我这边才是，对不起！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_i:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d900fb07b1dff921c8928a7277e9d41d2214d53291af688caa28ea5aaeb02c7",
      "text": "（……跳舞我虽然喜欢，\n被夸奖也很开心）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_i:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78f30c9bead53a5ffa8a11bb686e6d7e329f109ca60f38ae0843e37a0ab06620",
      "text": "（但这种应付，好麻烦啊——）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_j:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e6d3a0ef9711f9d426dd8a970505409e33658b31198243dab1a63298b38e963",
      "text": "～♪　～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_j:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1feeab3bedf318ccdb2680a89af4666fb0e901581af99ccd50ed99805060e2c",
      "text": "呼……好嘞，感觉不错。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_j:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e18aec906a208b669d500b3028a55efb4768e508b89e29417da952c7e7b5722",
      "text": "（周围的人也都在夸我，而且感觉自己的\n表现力确实也在一点点变好）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_j:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2fa150557096277b354e92b8df583c76cd608dad86dffb87a74e29b5d7deb10",
      "text": "（又敲定了一档音乐节目的出演。\n在正式演出前，还要再提升一下完成度……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_j:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13ea39afd54d3bd97fa20b420583bfe5f10b71dac8353e44918b7bc31e86d170",
      "text": "……喂。你是Jupiter的天濑冬马吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_j:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27a652c904fc2d3f9dfa2894d249f05a2d556c454c19a9dadb5b0c04b392a74e",
      "text": "是的……啊，辛苦了！\n前几天的音乐节目上，承蒙关照了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_j:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7650cf6acfaba30ad61e36b8aa8039612c2248ab51f4147a9e0257dea7fd999",
      "text": "那时的表现超级帅气的！\n您平时都是怎么练习的啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_j:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7eb5609119591327e584bbe3981d2151506e591b974cac41928c1dfca09b5c87",
      "text": "你这家伙，还真亏能用这种态度跟我搭话啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_j:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8cd134032f29309b58c9090e8d146e66b5963bed84696c557bffac119d14975",
      "text": "？这是什么意思……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_j:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ca404ea41bff64fcca04540ec91f886a0786e19517fd99aa36825f245de1b56",
      "text": "我们可是很困扰的啊。\n把原本找我们的工作给抢走了……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_j:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd9cce3fa07d76f821f7a1e9decbd168097a6395a474d18f4b2f867faa3aaf57",
      "text": "全都是因为你们的……\n因为961 Pro的社长到处施压……！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_03_1_1_001_03:1_1_001_03_j:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cf40be019b3d54392d8bcc21610e648f0ec5579c3508dcbffc4ad78ee8cc6a9",
      "text": "施压……？到底在，说什么啊……？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
